abstract: >-
  R analysis code for an ecological time-series study of ambient fungal
  spore exposure and asthma healthcare utilization in the San Juan
  Metropolitan Area, Puerto Rico, 2018-2021, stratified by age group and
  period (post-Hurricane María recovery and the COVID-19 pandemic).
